  "facts": [
    "The Mountain Golem is a troop unlocked in the Golem Quarry in the Clan Capital. He is trained through the Mountain Golem Quarry, a barracks constructed automatically when the Golem Quarry is rebuilt (unlocked at Capital Hall level 7)."
